<div class='pw-shell'>
	<div class='zcs-toast zcs-outline-toast zcs-theme-toast zcs-w-full zcs-flex zcs-gap-8 zcs-px-16 zcs-py-12 zcs-rounded-sm zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-lh-body zcs-color-primary'>
		<i class='zcs-toast-icon zcs-no-shrink zcs-lh-body zc-li-outline travel-info'></i>
		<div class='zcs-toast-text'>
			<p class='zcs-m-0'>This workbench does not use report custom-action workflows. Users act by opening the record, selecting <strong>Approver Action</strong>, entering <strong>Approval Remarks</strong> where required and saving. Form workflows validate the profile, delegation and current status before routing the record.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
	<div class='pw-guidance-grid zcs-py-16'>
		<div class='zcs-card zcs-p-20 zcs-box-border zcs-flex zcs-direction-column zcs-gap-16'>
			<h3 class='zcs-font-20 zcs-font-semibold zcs-color-primary zcs-m-0'>Status and action pattern</h3>
			<div class='pw-step'><h5 class='zcs-font-16 zcs-font-medium zcs-m-0'>1. Find the queue</h5><p class='zcs-font-14 zcs-color-secondary zcs-m-0'>Department cards and embedded reports show records where your profile can enter, approve, return, reopen or lock records.</p></div>
			<div class='pw-step'><h5 class='zcs-font-16 zcs-font-medium zcs-m-0'>2. Edit the record</h5><p class='zcs-font-14 zcs-color-secondary zcs-m-0'>Open the report row or module form. The form on-load workflow enables only the relevant planning and action fields for the current status.</p></div>
			<div class='pw-step'><h5 class='zcs-font-16 zcs-font-medium zcs-m-0'>3. Save to route</h5><p class='zcs-font-14 zcs-color-secondary zcs-m-0'>The on-validate and on-success workflows route the status, increment iterations on returns, lock approved baselines and write audit entries.</p></div>
		</div>
		<div class='zcs-card zcs-p-20 zcs-box-border'>
			<div class='zcs-notes-wrapper'>
				<span class='zcs-notes-title zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-lh-body zcs-color-tertiary'>Operational rules:</span>
				<ul class='zcs-m-0 zcs-pl-24 zcs-box-border'>
					<li class='zcs-pt-8 zcs-px-8 zcs-pb-0 zcs-box-border'><p class='zcs-notes-text zcs-m-0 zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary'>Use <strong>Submit</strong> from draft or returned records to move work to the next department.</p></li>
					<li class='zcs-pt-8 zcs-px-8 zcs-pb-0 zcs-box-border'><p class='zcs-notes-text zcs-m-0 zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary'>Use <strong>Approve</strong>, <strong>Finalise</strong> or <strong>Approve Final</strong> only when the profile owns the current approval stage.</p></li>
					<li class='zcs-pt-8 zcs-px-8 zcs-pb-0 zcs-box-border'><p class='zcs-notes-text zcs-m-0 zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary'>Use <strong>Return</strong> with remarks for corrections; returned records reappear in the originator's workqueue.</p></li>
					<li class='zcs-pt-8 zcs-px-8 zcs-pb-0 zcs-box-border'><p class='zcs-notes-text zcs-m-0 zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary'>Use <strong>Reopen</strong> or <strong>Lock</strong> only where Finance or administrators are explicitly allowed by the module workflow.</p></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			<div class='zcs-table-wrapper zcs-rounded-sm zcs-box-border zcs-relative zcs-mt-16'>
				<table class='zcs-w-full'>
					<thead class='zcs-sticky'><tr><th class='zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-color-primary'>Field</th><th class='zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-color-primary'>Purpose</th></tr></thead>
					<tbody>
						<tr><td class='zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary'>Status</td><td class='zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary'>Current workflow state and queue placement.</td></tr>
						<tr><td class='zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary'>Approver Action</td><td class='zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary'>User-selected transition such as Submit, Approve, Return, Reopen, Lock or Finalise.</td></tr>
						<tr><td class='zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary'>Approval Remarks</td><td class='zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary'>Mandatory explanation for returns and reopen requests.</td></tr>
						<tr><td class='zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary'>Locked</td><td class='zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-box-border zcs-font-14 zcs-color-primary'>Prevents further planning edits after approval or baseline lock.</td></tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>